cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this firmware in published work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "mouse-joystick-firm: firmware for the mouse joystick controller board"
abstract: >-
  RP2040 firmware for the mouse-joystick-pcb single-axis joystick controller,
  exposing one TMC5130A-driven joystick axis to a pyControl host over a UART
  line protocol, together with the pyControl device class, a board simulator
  and the protocol test corpus.
authors:
